7.description:
Very soon, you'll have the opportunity to demonstrate all your farming skills and tricks on an updated and significantly larger map. This map will be featured in the exciting game Farming Simulator 15 from Giants Software. The fields have been enlarged, not to mention planting vast tracts of wheat or corn alone — that wouldn't be nearly as exciting. The range of crops has been significantly expanded. New animals and buildings have also appeared on the map. And the farming fleet now includes over 100 licensed vehicles from 20 manufacturers. All in all, it's going to be a fruitful and exciting time!

Features of Farming Simulator 2015:
- Farming Simulator 15 torrent will be available for free download in 2015;
- an exciting single-player company that requires not only farming skills, but also management skills;
- an exciting cooperative mode that can unite 10 participants in one game;
- enlarged map with new buildings;
- new animals and crops;
- an expanded fleet of vehicles with equipment from well-known manufacturers;
- detailed graphics and realistic objects.

Repack features:
- Game version: 1.4.2
- Nothing is cut out.

DLC:

Repack features:
- Game version - 1.4.2.0
- Nothing has been cut/recoded
